    "title": "Jack Perry Explains How Relationship With Anna Jay Has Been Good For Him - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Manik Aftab ,\n7 hours ago Photo Credit: All Elite Wrestling Jack Perry opens up about his relationship with Anna Jay .\nOn the latest episode of Close-Up with Renee Paquette , the former AEW TNT Champion praised his girlfriend for being well-centered and grounded in real life.\n“It’s been five years,” he said. “She’s actually very good for me in the sense that she’s always — when I was more obsessive about wrestling and all that — she was always like, ‘It’s like we’re at a dinner. Can we not do all this right now?’\n“I mean, still sometimes I can’t turn it off, but she has always been very sort of well-centered and kind of grounded in real life. I keep saying what’s really important. Wrestling is important, and I like it, and I like being a wrestler, but… I laugh sometimes, too. I don’t know why. It’s always in the middle of the night when I wake up to pee. I think about how crazy it is that this is what I do and this is my job.” [H/T: NoDQ ]\nReport on Anna Jay’s AEW contract Anna Jay’s AEW contract is reportedly expiring way later than initially expected. Last month, following the early exit of TayJay in the AEW Women’s World Tag Team Title Tournament, it was reported that Anna Jay ‘s contract with the company was set to expire soon .\nIn a new update from Fightful’s Sean Ross Sapp (via Fightful Select ), Anna Jay’s contract with AEW isn’t set to expire until Spring of 2026. It was initially thought that her deal would be up before 2026, but that was incorrect.\nFans can check out the full details here .\nREAD MORE : Mercedes Moné Fires Back At Critics Of Her Title Collector Storyline In A Unique Way\nThe post Jack Perry Explains How Relationship With Anna Jay Has Been Good For Him appeared first on Wrestlezone .",
